<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Gaelic games-All-Ireland football results.</title>
<headline>Gaelic games-All-Ireland football results.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of All-Ireland gaelic football championship games played in Ireland on Sunday.</p>
<p>Leinster championship</p>
<p>    Offaly    5-17 (32)  Longford  0-13 (13)</p>
<p>    Wexford   2-05 (11)  Westmeath 0-11 (11)</p>
<p>(replay on May 17 in Mullingar, Westmeath)</p>
<p>Munster championship</p>
<p>Limerick  1-13 (16)  Tipperary 0-16 (16)</p>
<p>(replay on May 18 in Clonmel, Tipperary)</p>
<p>All-Ireland under-21 football final</p>
<p>    Derry     1-12 (15)  Meath     0-05 (05)</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377</p>
